NAME
       ip - show and manipulate addresses and routes

SYNOPSIS
       ip [ OBJECT ] [ COMMAND ]

DESCRIPTION
       A smaller version of the familiar tool.

OBJECTS
       ip link            list interfaces and their state
       ip addr            list interfaces with their addresses
       ip addr add A/N dev IF
                          set an address and prefix on an interface
       ip route           show the routing table
       ip route add default via GW dev IF
                          set the default gateway
       ip route del default dev IF
                          drop the default gateway

EXAMPLES
       ip addr add 10.0.0.5/24 dev eth0
       ip route add default via 10.0.0.1 dev eth0

SEE ALSO
       ifconfig(1), ping(1)
